{"id": "pos-01", "policy": "single_pass", "answerable": true, "partition": "simple_control", "status": "answered", "user_input": "长方形的周长为什么要把长和宽相加后乘2？", "response": "因为长方形有两条长和两条宽，周长是封闭图形一周边线的总长度，所以周长 = (长 + 宽) × 2 [C1]。例如长 8 厘米、宽 3 厘米时，周长是 (8+3)×2=22 厘米 [C1]。", "retrieved_contexts": ["# 长方形的周长\n\n周长是封闭图形一周边线的总长度。长方形有两条长和两条宽，所以周长 = (长 + 宽) × 2。例：长 8 厘米、宽 3 厘米，周长是 (8+3)×2=22 厘米。已知周长和宽，长 = 周长÷2 - 宽。周长描述边线长度，用厘米或米；面积描述内部大小，用平方厘米或平方米，不要混用公式和单位。"], "retrieved_context_ids": ["ddcc3253-aabb-5f65-9204-fa7da56c44f4"], "reference": "周长是封闭图形一周边线的总长度。长方形两条长相等、两条宽相等，所以周长=长+宽+长+宽=(长+宽)×2。", "known_ambiguity": false, "metrics": {"faithfulness": {"status": "scored", "value": 1.0, "provider_keys": ["eb1f64a59cf86d50a2582fd264f733e4da4b6bfb7875bf2f6f58be77779bcbe6", "4feebb0587d94ba84858939f9e615bd0dc9ab86091236aca33561923dd0cbbed"], "metric_key": "9a6eee7c1834d4195fcbd8f2ac771a27ce8511ef85cef188dbad4af95ad49724"}, "factual_correctness": {"status": "scored", "value": 0.75, "provider_keys": ["afd3bc85c817e40250366bb77fda8f395150feb2c8d3f92b909d1c939a5d1233", "0318f6cc85dc7228cff1b508eddf924c40c6f4cd48c52aa8e099a68ef2e11d9c", "481ae68201a65daa42c06e6240f80fc4c512d45674fb4d42682464c2536d8939", "7dbe604c3f211427880eaacbbb451c5f95367c3d50fff7b8e98bf0eeb6081019"], "metric_key": "91bfbd343d55d818d84fbc36ec13231281cf3a04b878ca4ad7c6eaa348cbf3ca"}, "context_precision": {"status": "scored", "value": 0.9999999999, "provider_keys": ["247432047bc9edfdfb582134993e613584f29c5bf64001ae5f84c7f9e49660ac"], "metric_key": "9a4ddbfba51715fd401d742213c8cb68fb9147c08f3a92e5740f430f4ae8d316"}, "context_recall": {"status": "scored", "value": 1.0, "provider_keys": ["47bd23acf240b7e00b998d3bf4d593ec1d4cb25764d7c12c9ba5dda1c932b624"], "metric_key": "65be49169add383139d2196f6d85f991015249e1733b91703fef8fc494ef55d7"}, "answer_accuracy": {"status": "scored", "value": 1.0, "provider_keys": ["24c0653f0a58c695f6582cb7e1add39e05ac745815e19f56fe9b86faf8c23a5c", "796efa39d70e2641806a8c41e5a0914278e74146acd8b767a84a9d161