{"id": "complex-17", "policy": "always_retry", "answerable": true, "partition": "new_authored_complex", "status": "answered", "user_input": "三年级数学：96元买每本8元的书，能买几本？把这些书平均放到3个架子上，每架几本？", "response": "先算能买几本：96÷8＝12（本），表示96元里面包含12个8元 [C22]。\n再把这些书平均放到3个架子上：12÷3＝4（本），每架放4本 [C22]。\n答：能买12本；平均放到3个架子上，每架4本。", "retrieved_contexts": ["# 一位数除法与验算\n\n除法可以看成把一个数量平均分，或求里面包含几个相同的数量。计算多位数除以一位数时，从被除数的高位除起，商写在对应数位上。不带余数的除法，用商 × 除数 = 被除数来验算；有余数时，用商 × 除数 + 余数来验算。例如 84÷4=21，可用 21×4=84 验算；47÷5=9……2，可用 9×5+2=47 验算。"], "retrieved_context_ids": ["3a5d1294-af72-5cd2-94f8-d023d2230af3"], "reference": "总价÷单价=数量，96÷8=12本书。平均分到3个架子，每架12÷3=4本。可用8×12=96、3×4=12验算。", "known_ambiguity": false, "metrics": {"faithfulness": {"status": "scored", "value": 0.0, "provider_keys": ["38c9a83f4c5baeeb7f0c81e57610b7bcdff2745be1869a69f36736e8e94928bc", "2d16f009c614ff96b9c92ba9510f7173f6fe36f0814d5c4a5ea021b1eaccbf17"], "metric_key": "dce22c501e176170ae222afc8c667d5b73fc6bb39a12d91981c39c81a8c74e8b"}, "factual_correctness": {"status": "scored", "value": 0.8, "provider_keys": ["6ac7103de4fc45504d007294b74002b0538797b18c15711dad3c6b0c49fe8fc2", "9a96128eceba9ec9f933d9b45b92a0b458b83b27f51cd98c8d813ce6ec9aa05a", "15e3b7406d067ac9c50987ea7f3521dfa6c2eac88b7e9b7610a521991ae4cd02", "91cf93ffeeee1de2c315e77314c3ea73d0eb689159a6bc86f9fccb761fa645e5"], "metric_key": "59d81958c2994bf97f86ed55e314c435d8e4be1cef690ef1a4072b9ae8b66a85"}, "context_precision": {"status": "scored", "value": 0.9999999999, "provider_keys": ["8002c7302391faf11aefdf734cbc155bcb0cf2e3c3ed8378580b34d3d2492a58"], "metric_key": "41198fb2ba9d8b4666aa4c4f1dce6db3dca67990e4b0648e486b647f3b7b046f"}, "context_recall": {"status": "scored", "value": 1.0, "provider_keys": ["f1c7fe2ab50f6166edb62e3a146b0e1f94db039628e000e28caa22e277f78f68"], "metric_key": "fbdda74363c1528e43a999a4849ec689a291fce59d689c0f4754a09ab972ccae"}, "answer_accuracy": {"status": "scored", "value": 1.0, "provider_keys": ["799327b5b82cb254a477a02235a660cc70945b65c41a23de224fe11261a1d95d", 